script: the Cyrillic alphabet. title: Your first Cyrillic letters. description: Read short words like мама and кот. canDo: Read and say А, О, М, Т, К. Intro: Look-alike letters, different sounds. Some Cyrillic letters look Latin but sound different: Р (r) sounds like the r in "caro", and Н (n) like the n in "nada". Letters: А (a), ipa a, pronunciation: like the a in "pai", short. О (o), ipa o, pronunciation: like the o in "bolo" when stressed. М (m), ipa m, pronunciation: like the m in "mão". Summary: Each letter has one sound. Read from left to right.